        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/3fc6b3bad97dd935706342275c7f4f77.webp?t=1752656403\" width=453 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through 18 levels of platform mayhem in a quest to save mankind from the grip of a totalitarian  regime. Every level is a playground of possibilities, where quick thinking and quicker reflexes are the keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/77c35d4e3a9a03071ae5baffc40ccf94.poster.avif?t=1752656403\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/77c35d4e3a9a03071ae5baffc40ccf94.webm?t=1752656403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/77c35d4e3a9a03071ae5baffc40ccf94.mp4?t=1752656403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/a97531bbe35ebc36369d0b10e5bd5475.webp?t=1752656403\" width=453 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll find opportunities to enhance your crucial systems. Weapon upgrades pack more punch against tougher enemies. Shield improvements give you better protection when things get hectic. Battery enhancements let you push deeper into hostile territory. And perhaps most crucial of all, life support upgrades keep you alive in increasingly dangerous environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/d8b27aa4b296a3ee6038c452187c77e1.avif?t=1752656403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras_big/d8b27aa4b296a3ee6038c452187c77e1.avif?t=1752656403 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/6f066578782ac34effa08799077f989c.webp?t=1752656403\" width=453 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fast-paced platformer demands split-second timing and combat precision. Players navigate through meticulously crafted levels that shift from neon-drenched industrial zones to snow-covered mountain outposts, each area presenting unique platforming challenges and enemy types. Rusted worker bots patrol abandoned factories, sleek combat drones sweep across open valleys, and massive mechanical bosses guard crucial chokepoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/e9a800b3ebb812fc6707589a2471ec4d.poster.avif?t=1752656403\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/e9a800b3ebb812fc6707589a2471ec4d.webm?t=1752656403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/e9a800b3ebb812fc6707589a2471ec4d.mp4?t=1752656403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/3fc6b3bad97dd935706342275c7f4f77.webp?t=1752656403\" width=453 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through 18 levels of platform mayhem in a quest to save mankind from the grip of a totalitarian  regime. Every level is a playground of possibilities, where quick thinking and quicker reflexes are the keys to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/77c35d4e3a9a03071ae5baffc40ccf94.poster.avif?t=1752656403\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/77c35d4e3a9a03071ae5baffc40ccf94.webm?t=1752656403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/77c35d4e3a9a03071ae5baffc40ccf94.mp4?t=1752656403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/a97531bbe35ebc36369d0b10e5bd5475.webp?t=1752656403\" width=453 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you'll find opportunities to enhance your crucial systems. Weapon upgrades pack more punch against tougher enemies. Shield improvements give you better protection when things get hectic. Battery enhancements let you push deeper into hostile territory. And perhaps most crucial of all, life support upgrades keep you alive in increasingly dangerous environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/d8b27aa4b296a3ee6038c452187c77e1.avif?t=1752656403\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras_big/d8b27aa4b296a3ee6038c452187c77e1.avif?t=1752656403 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/6f066578782ac34effa08799077f989c.webp?t=1752656403\" width=453 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This fast-paced platformer demands split-second timing and combat precision. Players navigate through meticulously crafted levels that shift from neon-drenched industrial zones to snow-covered mountain outposts, each area presenting unique platforming challenges and enemy types. Rusted worker bots patrol abandoned factories, sleek combat drones sweep across open valleys, and massive mechanical bosses guard crucial chokepoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/e9a800b3ebb812fc6707589a2471ec4d.poster.avif?t=1752656403\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/e9a800b3ebb812fc6707589a2471ec4d.webm?t=1752656403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486490/extras/e9a800b3ebb812fc6707589a2471ec4d.mp4?t=1752656403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
